# November 24, 2026: Douglas County, Kansas, leftovers (Lawrence, Eudora, Baldwin City, Vinland, Overbrook). Register listings
# the Atlas did not yet hold: an old industrial block in East Lawrence, a college hall, a territorial-era store in Eudora,
# a community fairground, and five farmsteads.
# Facts from the linked sources only: National Register forms read as text (Kansas Historical Society and NPGallery,
# tools/page.py and a PDF reader), the Society's register summaries, Douglas County's event page, the Lawrence Journal-World,
# and a Clio entry. Pins were checked on the Kansas state aerial and the LiDAR sheet.
